{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "0603USB-951MLC",
 "kind": "common_mode_choke",
 "manufacturer": "Coilcraft",
 "title": "0603USB series: 0603 ferrite common mode chokes for USB 3.x and other high-speed differential lines",
 "source": {
  "document": "Document 406",
  "revision": "Revised 09/10/24",
  "pages": 2
 },
 "summary": "A family of five two-winding ferrite common mode chokes in a 1.52 x 0.76 mm (0603) four-terminal package, made to reject common-mode noise on fast differential pairs such as USB 3.x, USB 2.0, HDMI 2.0, DisplayPort, DVI, HDBaseT, IEEE1394 and LVDS, and suited to USB Type-C specification 1.0. Across the five values the differential cutoff falls from 3.8 GHz to 0.96 GHz as the common-mode peak impedance rises from 0.10 to 0.66 kOhm. 0603USB-951MLC is the 63 nH, 0.30 kOhm part on a 7-inch reel of 2000.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Common mode peak impedance (951)",
   "0.30 kOhm at 2.6 GHz"
  ],
  [
   "Differential mode -3 dB cutoff (951)",
   "2.8 GHz"
  ],
